      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i'm just really scared of hospitals and the ER costs are insane right now. i've had these types of migraines before where the aura is really weird... could the arm weakness just be part of the neurological stuff from the migraine? like, is there any way i can just wait this out at home with some extra ibuprofen or something instead of going in?",
